1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:01,700
and say "a-ha" again?

2
00:00:06,727 --> 00:00:09,177
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, Sheldon.
I should've told you I was back.

3
00:00:09,329 --> 00:00:11,239
(Leonard:)I just wanted to have
a couple days alone with Penny.

4
00:00:11,398 --> 00:00:13,538
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, I should apologize.

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,380
(Sheldon:)I never realized to what extent
our friendship was a burden to you.

6
00:00:17,538 --> 00:00:19,078
(Leonard:)That is not fair.

7
00:00:19,239 --> 00:00:22,379
(Leonard:)I complain about what a burden it is
at least once a month.

8
00:00:22,543 --> 00:00:24,183
Oh, no, no, Iefs not sugarcoat this.

9
00:00:24,344 --> 00:00:27,844
You find me tinicky,
pedantic and annoying.

10
00:00:28,015 --> 00:00:29,185
(Penny:)No, he doesn't.

11
00:00:29,349 --> 00:00:32,759
(Leonard:)I actually have used
those exact words before.

12
00:00:34,021 --> 00:00:35,091
(Leonard:)In that order.

13
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:38,430
(Sheldon:)Well, Leonard,
I think it's high time

14
00:00:38,592 --> 00:00:41,732
(Sheldon:)you and I address
the "tweepadock" in the room.

15
00:00:43,163 --> 00:00:44,403
(Leonard:)-The what?
-Amy?

16
00:00:44,565 --> 00:00:47,205
(Amy:)-Please leave me out of this.
-Fine.

17
00:00:47,367 --> 00:00:51,177
(Sheldon:)Leonard, there's no need for you
to pretend to like me anymore.

18
00:00:51,338 --> 00:00:54,408
(Leonard:)-Come on, I said I was sorry.
-No, no, you save your apologies

19
00:00:54,575 --> 00:01:00,025
(Sheldon:)for after you've had
disappointing coitus with Penny.

